# Target pressure BELOW the fixture's instantaneous pressure, so the cell must
# grow. This is the sign-sensitive half of the pair: the fixture sits at roughly
# +1000 bar, and 200 bar is below that in bar but far ABOVE it when the same
# number is mistaken for eV/A^3 (1000 bar is 6.2e-4 eV/A^3). A barostat
# comparing a bar target against an eV/A^3 pressure therefore compresses here
# instead of expanding, which is the failure this case exists to catch.
velocity 300.0
run 500
velocity_init random
velocity_seed 20260830
remove_com_velocity true
time_step 2.0
output_interval 10

force_field lj
cutoff 6.0
type 1 Ar epsilon 0.01032 sigma 3.405 charge 0.0

thermostat nose_hoover
thermostat_tau 100.0

barostat berendsen
barostat_tau 1000.0
compressibility 4.5e-5
pressure 200.0
